        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(1) Clinics operated under the TOI PCs, whereby we receive a percentage of revenues under our management services agreements, or MSAs, and are consolidated",
        "start_character": 23953,
        "end_character": 24108
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The non-medical functions and services we provide under the management services agreements include practice management services and non-clinical operational",
        "start_character": 14372,
        "end_character": 14528
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through TOI Clinical Research, LLC (\"TCR\"), the clinical research arm of our affiliated professional corporations, or TOI PCs, we also provide and manage clinical trial services and research for the benefit of cancer patients, as well as palliative care for patients in the last stages of disease.",
        "start_character": 6394,
        "end_character": 6691
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our management services agreements, we have agreed to serve, on an exclusive basis, as manager and administrator of each TOI PC’s non-medical functions and services related to healthcare services and items provided to patients by physicians and other licensed healthcare providers employed by or under contract with a TOI PC.",
        "start_character": 14040,
        "end_character": 14371
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are generally reliant on outside referrals of these fee-for-service patients, who may be in the care of a primary care provider, non-oncology specialist physician, or hospitalist, who then refers the patient upon diagnosis to an oncology provider within TOI.",
        "start_character": 2620,
        "end_character": 2881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our existing payor relationships provide us leads on opportunities to enter new markets, and we often receive outreach from new management services organizations, health plans and risk bearing organizations.",
        "start_character": 25067,
        "end_character": 25290
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete with large and medium-sized local and national providers of cancer care services, such as health system affiliated practices, for, among other things, contracts with payors, recruitment of physicians and other medical and non-medical personnel and patients.",
        "start_character": 35101,
        "end_character": 35369
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also entered into medical director agreements with each physician under which the physician provides certain administrative services to the TOI PCs on our behalf for nominal compensation.",
        "start_character": 17177,
        "end_character": 17372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have entered into a management services agreement with each of the TOI PCs, which are entirely physician owned.",
        "start_character": 13925,
        "end_character": 14039
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Where we are entering capitation contracts under our fully delegated model, we are also committing to providing traditional managed care administrative services, including i) network administration;",
        "start_character": 30408,
        "end_character": 30606
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Service Expansion: We can broaden scope and diversify service offerings, including ancillary and adjacent services focused on patient care and innovation and providing access to new oncology treatments being investigated in clinical trials that our affiliated practices manage.",
        "start_character": 28564,
        "end_character": 28842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001799191-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001799191-26-000007-e5d66f434fe841a9",
        "accession_number": "0001799191-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By opening clinics in locations where the TOI PCs currently manage the oncology care for a large number of insured Medicare, commercial and Medicaid members, we believe we are creating net benefits for payors, as our affiliated providers are able to reduce unnecessary costs and improve patient care and experience.",
        "start_character": 31643,
        "end_character": 31958
      }
